{% comment %}
  ASTER Password / Waiting List Landing
  Version: V50
  Purpose: Portable, self-contained Shopify section for the temporary ASTER launch/password page.
  Notes:
  - No dependency on existing theme CSS or JavaScript.
  - Uses the supplied ASTER background, foreground canopy and SVG logo as defaults.
  - The logo is rendered with CSS masking so its colour can be controlled in code.
  - Demo mode is enabled by default so the form can be styled/tested before Klaviyo is connected.
  - V2 fixes Shopify schema validation for the optional logo URL setting.
  - V3 fixes range-step schema validation and verifies all range defaults.
  - V4 replaces the manual logo URL field with a standard Shopify image picker.
  - V5 rebalances the composition: canopy higher, logo centred and reliably rendered, form anchored to the bottom, and mobile canopy scaling corrected.
  - V6 removes all hard-coded image fallbacks. Theme Editor image selectors now fully control background, canopy and logo assets.
  - V7 adds a much larger true mobile scene raise and a mobile background fill layer so the composition can move upwards without exposing an empty lower edge.
  - V8 adds an adjustable blur hold delay before the background and canopy begin their unblur/focus animation.
  - V9 resolves Theme Check warnings: adds intrinsic logo dimensions and reduces the schema to 50 configurable settings by locking low-value visual micro-settings to the Aster design.
  - V10 removes the exposed desktop lower-edge fallback, keeps a stationary background fill behind the animated scene, and reduces the schema to 38 configurable settings.
  - V11 redesigns the store-access modal with a wine-red liquid-glass treatment and reuses the selected ASTER logo above the password field.
  - V12 replaces the coloured modal with a genuinely translucent iOS-style liquid-glass treatment that blurs, saturates and visually refracts the page behind it.
  - V13 makes the store-access panel materially more transparent, removes the close-button pill, and adds smooth animated open/close states.
  - V14 prevents the glass panel from becoming visually empty during its entrance, reduces frosting strength, and refines the store-password heading.
  - V15 keeps the glass fully rendered throughout the entrance/exit animation, removes decorative lens overlays, and reduces the glass effect to a cleaner low-blur transparent treatment.
  - V16 adds a darker full-screen overlay behind the store-access glass panel so the transparent glass reads more clearly without increasing the panel opacity.
  - V17 darkens the store-access backdrop further and synchronises the close animation so the glass panel exits with its contents instead of lingering empty.
  - V18 replaces the abrupt final hide with a short unified fade/scale/translate exit, while leaving the successful entrance animation unchanged.
  - V19 increases the store-access backdrop darkness by 50% while leaving the glass panel and animations unchanged.
  - V20 replaces the radial store-access backdrop with one uniform solid wine-black overlay at 55% opacity.
  - V21 stabilises the desktop composition on ultra-wide displays by capping the animated scene to a 1.9:1 viewport ratio while the underlying background continues to fill the full screen.
  - V22 expands the mobile form distance-from-bottom control from 60px to 240px.
  - V23 fixes Shopify range validation by changing the mobile form offset step from 2px to 4px.
  - V24 adds a Theme Editor control for the store-access overlay strength.
  - V25 removes the previous desktop scene width cap and switches desktop background/canopy rendering to intrinsic-height sizing so wider replacement assets can bleed naturally beyond the viewport edges.
  - V26 expands the desktop background scale control to 60–200% for substantially more positioning freedom with oversized source canvases.
  - V27 converts the desktop horizontal/vertical focal controls into true scene-position controls so they move the matched background and canopy after the intrinsic-height rendering change.
  - V28 adds a full-screen Aster red intro overlay (#6b2331) that fades out before the background begins its unblur transition.
  - V29 replaces the CSS-delay intro timing with an explicit JavaScript sequence so the #6b2331 intro screen is guaranteed to render before fading.
  - V30 makes the intro deterministic: the section itself starts #6b2331, the overlay is forced fully opaque, and it cannot fade until both the hold timer and critical assets are ready.
  - V31 synchronises the #6b2331 overlay fade and background de-blur so both transitions begin on the same frame.
  - V32 adds a Klaviyo embedded-form submission bridge while preserving the native Aster form UI, plus fully custom required-field validation for first name, last name and email.
  - V33 removes expanding per-field error blocks. Validation now highlights fields in place and uses one fixed-height Aster-styled status line so the form height never grows into the logo.
  - V34 removes all in-flow waiting-list messages and replaces them with one absolutely positioned Aster toast, preventing validation or success states from changing panel height.
  - V35 removes validation-on-blur so no validation toast can appear on initial page load. Validation now begins only after an attempted submission.
  - V36 removes the server-rendered waiting-list error fallback so the validation toast is always empty and hidden on initial load.
  - V37 removes the waiting-list popup/toast system entirely. Validation feedback is now displayed dynamically inside the existing Join the waiting list button.
  - V38 keeps the button label permanently as Join the waiting list. When fields are incomplete, clicking the button only validates/highlights them; submission is blocked until all three fields are valid.
  - V39 makes the waiting-list button non-native and fully gated by JavaScript. Its label reports the exact missing fields, returns to Join the waiting list only when all three fields are valid, and only then can submission occur.
  - V40 adds a viewport-aware desktop composition engine. The signup panel scales from both available width and height, the matched background/canopy scene scales on compact desktops, and a live collision guard prevents the form from obscuring the ASTER logo. Mobile retains its dedicated composition.
  - V41 replaces the independent collision adjustments with a coordinated desktop composition: the matched canopy/background scene is hard-centred, the form scales only to fit the available vertical space, and the ASTER logo is continuously centred in the gap between canopy and form.
  - V42 removes the legacy desktop logo vertical override and derives the ASTER position from the actual rendered canopy and form geometry. The desktop logo is fixed to true horizontal centre and placed at the exact midpoint of the visible canopy/form gap.
  - V43 centres the signup panel without transform-based horizontal offsets and detects the actual visible bounds of the selected canopy and logo assets at runtime, allowing ASTER to be visually centred between the canopy and form on every desktop size.
  - V44 extends the measured composition system to mobile. The visible canopy is fitted to the viewport width, the signup panel scales only when mobile height requires it, and the visible ASTER artwork is centred between the measured canopy edge and the final signup-panel top.
  - V45 simplifies mobile into one vertically centred three-part composition: cropped canopy, ASTER logo and signup panel. Their internal gaps stay stable while excess viewport height becomes breathing room above and below. The embedded background canopy is suppressed on mobile to eliminate ghosting.
  - V46 removes the desktop minimum-height override so the hero never creates a page scrollbar on shorter desktops. On mobile, a feathered crop of the matched background image is aligned directly beneath the foreground canopy so the original canopy shadow is restored without reintroducing a ghost canopy.
  - V47 removes the mobile shadow crop box entirely and moves the aligned matched-background shadow layer behind the logo with a four-sided feather, eliminating visible crop edges and logo obscuration. Desktop now centres the complete canopy-to-form composition vertically and explicitly suppresses document scrolling.
  - V48 adds a continuous compact-desktop fit for shorter viewport heights. The canopy scene and signup panel reduce slightly as desktop height decreases, increasing breathing room around ASTER while leaving large desktop and mobile compositions unchanged.
  - V49 removes the independent CSS scale layer that caused the desktop canopy to drift horizontally. Compact desktop scaling is now folded into the scene's single centred transform scale, preserving true horizontal centring at every desktop height.
  - V50 precomputes the final resting desktop geometry behind the solid intro overlay before entrance animations begin. Post-animation geometry corrections are removed, so the canopy, ASTER logo and signup panel animate directly to already-locked final coordinates without a finishing shift.
{% endcomment %}

{% liquid
  assign section_id = 'AsterLanding-' | append: section.id

  if section.settings.background_image != blank
    assign background_src = section.settings.background_image | image_url: width: 3000
  endif

  if section.settings.canopy_image != blank
    assign canopy_src = section.settings.canopy_image | image_url: width: 3000
  endif

  if section.settings.logo_image != blank
    assign logo_src = section.settings.logo_image | image_url: width: 1800
  endif

  assign scene_x_desktop = section.settings.background_x_desktop | minus: 50 | times: 0.5
  assign scene_y_desktop = section.settings.background_y_desktop | minus: 50
  assign scene_y_desktop = scene_y_desktop | minus: section.settings.scene_raise_desktop
  assign klaviyo_form_id = section.settings.klaviyo_form_id | strip
%}

<section
  id="{{ section_id }}"
  class="aster-landing"
  data-aster-landing
  data-demo-mode="{{ section.settings.demo_mode }}"
  data-intro-hold="{{ section.settings.focus_delay }}"
  data-intro-fade="700"
  style="
    --aster-bg-x-desktop: {{ section.settings.background_x_desktop }}%;
    --aster-bg-y-desktop: {{ section.settings.background_y_desktop }}%;
    --aster-bg-y-mobile: 50%;
    --aster-scene-scale-desktop: {{ section.settings.background_scale_desktop | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    --aster-scene-x-desktop: {{ scene_x_desktop }}%;
    --aster-scene-y-desktop: {{ scene_y_desktop }}%;
    --aster-logo-width-desktop: {{ section.settings.logo_width_desktop }}vw;
    --aster-logo-x-desktop: 50%;
    --aster-form-bottom-desktop: {{ section.settings.form_bottom_desktop }}px;
    --aster-form-width: {{ section.settings.form_width }}px;
    --aster-blur: {{ section.settings.initial_blur }}px;
    --aster-intro-fade-duration: 700ms;
    --aster-focus-start-delay: 0ms;
    --aster-focus-duration: 700ms;
    --aster-logo-duration: {{ section.settings.logo_duration }}ms;
    --aster-logo-delay: {{ section.settings.logo_delay }}ms;
    --aster-logo-travel: {{ section.settings.logo_reveal_distance }}px;
    --aster-form-duration: {{ section.settings.form_duration }}ms;
    --aster-form-delay: {{ section.settings.form_delay }}ms;
    --aster-copy-colour: #e6d3bd;
    --aster-field-text: #f3e7d8;
    --aster-field-placeholder: #c9baa8;
    --aster-field-bg: rgba(7, 12, 8, 0.46);
    --aster-button-bg: #e6d3bd;
    --aster-button-text: #111611;
    --aster-panel-bg: rgba(8, 14, 9, 0.34);
    --aster-panel-blur: 14px;
    --aster-heading-size-desktop: {{ section.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    --aster-heading-size-mobile: {{ section.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    --aster-password-overlay-opacity: {{ section.settings.password_overlay_strength | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    --aster-desktop-ui-fit: 1;
    --aster-desktop-scene-render-scale: var(--aster-scene-scale-desktop);
    --aster-responsive-logo-top: 50%;
    --aster-desktop-group-shift-y: 0px;
  "
>
  <div
    class="aster-landing__intro-overlay"
    aria-hidden="true"
    style="position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:999;background:#6b2331;opacity:1;"
  ></div>

  <div class="aster-landing__scene" aria-hidden="true">
    {% if background_src != blank %}
      <img class="aster-landing__background-fill" src="{{ background_src }}" alt="" width="3000" height="2000" loading="eager" decoding="async">
      <img class="aster-landing__background" src="{{ background_src }}" alt="" width="3000" height="2000" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-aster-background>
    {% endif %}
    {% if section.settings.background_overlay_opacity > 0 and background_src != blank %}
      <div class="aster-landing__shade" style="--aster-overlay-opacity: {{ section.settings.background_overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};"></div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  {% if background_src != blank and canopy_src != blank %}
    <div class="aster-landing__canopy-shadow-layer" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="aster-landing__canopy-shadow-source" src="{{ background_src }}" alt="" width="3000" height="2000" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-aster-canopy-shadow>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if logo_src != blank %}
    <div class="aster-landing__logo-wrap" aria-hidden="true" data-aster-logo>
      <img class="aster-landing__logo" src="{{ logo_src }}" alt="" width="1800" height="410" loading="eager" decoding="async">
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  {% if canopy_src != blank %}
    <div class="aster-landing__foreground" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="aster-landing__canopy" src="{{ canopy_src }}" alt="" width="3000" height="2000" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" data-aster-canopy>
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="aster-landing__content" data-aster-content>
    <div class="aster-landing__panel">
      {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}<h1 class="aster-landing__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>{% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.supporting_text != blank %}<div class="aster-landing__supporting rte">{{ section.settings.supporting_text }}</div>{% endif %}

      {% form 'customer', id: 'AsterWaitingListForm', novalidate: 'novalidate' %}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter,aster-waiting-list">
        <div class="aster-landing__form-grid">
          <div class="aster-landing__field">
            <label class="aster-landing__visually-hidden" for="AsterFirstName-{{ section.id }}">First name</label>
            <input id="AsterFirstName-{{ section.id }}" type="text" name="contact[first_name]" autocomplete="given-name" placeholder="First name" data-aster-field="first_name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="aster-landing__field">
            <label class="aster-landing__visually-hidden" for="AsterLastName-{{ section.id }}">Last name</label>
            <input id="AsterLastName-{{ section.id }}" type="text" name="contact[last_name]" autocomplete="family-name" placeholder="Last name" data-aster-field="last_name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="aster-landing__field aster-landing__field--wide">
            <label class="aster-landing__visually-hidden" for="AsterEmail-{{ section.id }}">Email address</label>
            <input id="AsterEmail-{{ section.id }}" type="email" name="contact[email]" autocomplete="email" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Email address" data-aster-field="email" required>
          </div>
          <div class="aster-landing__field aster-landing__field--wide">
            <button class="aster-landing__submit" type="button" data-aster-waitlist-button aria-disabled="true"><span data-aster-submit-label data-default-label="{{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}">{{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}</span></button>
          </div>
        </div>
      {% endform %}

      {% if klaviyo_form_id != blank %}
        <div class="aster-klaviyo-engine" data-aster-klaviyo-engine data-klaviyo-form-id="{{ klaviyo_form_id | escape }}" aria-hidden="true"><div class="klaviyo-form-{{ klaviyo_form_id | escape }}"></div></div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.privacy_text != blank %}<div class="aster-landing__privacy rte">{{ section.settings.privacy_text }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if section.settings.show_password_link %}
    <a class="aster-landing__password-link" href="#aster-password-modal" data-aster-password-trigger>{{ section.settings.password_link_label | escape }}</a>
    <div class="aster-password-modal" id="aster-password-modal" data-aster-password-modal hidden>
      <button class="aster-password-modal__backdrop" type="button" aria-label="Close password form" data-aster-password-close></button>
      <div class="aster-password-modal__dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="AsterPasswordTitle-{{ section.id }}">
        <button class="aster-password-modal__close" type="button" aria-label="Close password form" data-aster-password-close>×</button>
        {% if logo_src != blank %}<div class="aster-password-modal__brand" aria-hidden="true"><img class="aster-password-modal__logo" src="{{ logo_src }}" alt="" width="900" height="205" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div>{% endif %}
        <h2 id="AsterPasswordTitle-{{ section.id }}">Enter store password</h2>
        {% form 'storefront_password', class: 'aster-password-modal__form' %}
          <label class="aster-landing__visually-hidden" for="AsterPassword-{{ section.id }}">Password</label>
          <input id="AsterPassword-{{ section.id }}" type="password" name="password" placeholder="Password" autocomplete="current-password">
          <button type="submit">Enter</button>
          {% if form.errors %}<div class="aster-password-modal__errors">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% endform %}
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<style>
  #{{ section_id }} {position:relative;width:100%;min-height:100vh;min-height:100svh;min-height:100dvh;overflow:hidden;isolation:isolate;background:#6b2331;color:var(--aster-copy-colour);font-family:inherit}
  #{{ section_id }} *,#{{ section_id }} *::before,#{{ section_id }} *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
  html:has(#{{ section_id }}),body:has(#{{ section_id }}){width:100%;height:100%;max-height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden!important;overscroll-behavior:none}
  @media screen and (min-width:750px){#{{ section_id }}{height:100dvh;min-height:0;max-height:100dvh;overflow:hidden;overflow:clip}}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__intro-overlay{display:block!important;visibility:visible!important;opacity:1!important;background:#6b2331!important;pointer-events:auto;will-change:opacity;transition:opacity var(--aster-intro-fade-duration) cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
  #{{ section_id }}.aster-landing--intro-fading .aster-landing__intro-overlay{opacity:0!important;pointer-events:none}
  #{{ section_id }}.aster-landing--intro-complete .aster-landing__intro-overlay{display:none!important}
  @media screen and (min-width:750px){#{{ section_id }}.aster-landing--prelayout .aster-landing__background,#{{ section_id }}.aster-landing--prelayout .aster-landing__canopy{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;transform:translate(-50%,var(--aster-scene-y-desktop)) scale(var(--aster-desktop-scene-render-scale))!important}#{{ section_id }}.aster-landing--prelayout .aster-landing__content{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;transform:translateY(0)!important}#{{ section_id }}.aster-landing--prelayout .aster-landing__logo-wrap{transition:none!important;animation:none!important;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(1)!important}}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__scene,#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__foreground{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden;pointer-events:none}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__scene{z-index:1}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__foreground{z-index:30}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__canopy-shadow-layer,#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__canopy-shadow-source{display:none}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__background-fill{display:block;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center var(--aster-bg-y-desktop);filter:blur(var(--aster-blur));transform:scale(1.03);transform-origin:center center;pointer-events:none;will-change:filter,transform;transition:filter var(--aster-focus-duration) cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) 0ms,transform var(--aster-focus-duration) cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) 0ms}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__background,#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__canopy{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:50%;width:auto;max-width:none;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;translate:0 var(--aster-desktop-group-shift-y);transform:translate(-50%,var(--aster-scene-y-desktop)) scale(calc(var(--aster-desktop-scene-render-scale) + .025));transform-origin:center center;filter:blur(var(--aster-blur));will-change:transform,filter;transition:filter var(--aster-focus-duration) cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) 0ms,transform var(--aster-focus-duration) cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1) 0ms}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__background{-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent 0%,#000 3%,#000 97%,transparent 100%);mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent 0%,#000 3%,#000 97%,transparent 100%)}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__shade{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;background:rgba(0,0,0,var(--aster-overlay-opacity));pointer-events:none}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__logo-wrap{position:absolute;z-index:20;top:var(--aster-responsive-logo-top);left:50%;width:min(var(--aster-logo-width-desktop),760px,55dvh);aspect-ratio:4.4/1;translate:0 0;transform:translate(-50%,calc(-50% - var(--aster-logo-travel))) scale(.985);opacity:0;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 0 rgba(0,0,0,0)) drop-shadow(0 0 0 rgba(230,211,189,0));will-change:transform,opacity,filter,top;pointer-events:none}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__logo{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;filter:brightness(0) saturate(100%) invert(52.7%) sepia(17.4%) saturate(301.5%) hue-rotate(-8.1deg) brightness(167.9%) contrast(80.6%)}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__content{position:absolute;z-index:40;top:auto;bottom:var(--aster-form-bottom-desktop);left:0;right:0;margin-inline:auto;width:min(var(--aster-form-width),calc(100vw - 48px));translate:0 var(--aster-desktop-group-shift-y);scale:var(--aster-desktop-ui-fit);transform:translateY(26px);transform-origin:center bottom;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;will-change:transform,opacity,scale;transition:scale 220ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__panel{position:relative;width:100%;padding:{{ section.settings.panel_padding_desktop }}px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--aster-panel-bg);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(var(--aster-panel-blur));backdrop-filter:blur(var(--aster-panel-blur));box-shadow:0 22px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.16),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.07)}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__heading{margin:0;color:var(--aster-copy-colour);font:inherit;font-size:var(--aster-heading-size-desktop);font-weight:500;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:0;text-align:center;text-wrap:balance}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__supporting{margin:12px auto 0;max-width:580px;color:var(--aster-copy-colour);font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center;opacity:.82}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__supporting>*:first-child,#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__privacy>*:first-child{margin-top:0}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__supporting>*:last-child,#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__privacy>*:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
  #{{ section_id }} form{margin-top:18px}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field{min-width:0}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field--wide{grid-column:1/-1}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field input,#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit{display:block;width:100%;height:52px;margin:0;border-radius:12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;line-height:1;appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field input{border:1px solid rgba(230,211,189,.22);outline:none;padding:0 18px;background:var(--aster-field-bg);color:var(--aster-field-text);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.04);transition:border-color 180ms ease,background-color 180ms ease,box-shadow 180ms ease}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field input::placeholder{color:var(--aster-field-placeholder);opacity:1}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field input:focus{border-color:rgba(230,211,189,.62);background:rgba(6,10,7,.58);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(230,211,189,.09),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05)}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field input.is-invalid{border-color:rgba(230,211,189,.82);background:rgba(107,35,49,.42);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(230,211,189,.075),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.055)}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__field input.is-invalid::placeholder{color:rgba(230,211,189,.9)}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-klaviyo-engine{position:absolute!important;top:0!important;left:-10000px!important;width:640px!important;min-height:300px!important;overflow:hidden!important;opacity:.001!important;pointer-events:none!important;z-index:-1!important}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border:0;outline:none;padding:0 24px;background:var(--aster-button-bg);color:var(--aster-button-text);cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em;transition:transform 180ms ease,opacity 180ms ease,background-color 180ms ease,color 180ms ease}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit[aria-disabled=true]{cursor:pointer}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit.is-field-prompt{background:#6b2331;color:#e6d3bd;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(230,211,189,.18),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.045)}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(110deg,transparent 20%,rgba(255,255,255,.18) 48%,transparent 74%);transform:translateX(-130%);transition:transform 650ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit span{position:relative;z-index:1}@media(hover:hover){#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit:hover{transform:translateY(-1px)}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit:hover::before{transform:translateX(130%)}}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__submit:active{transform:translateY(0)}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__privacy{margin:12px auto 0;max-width:560px;color:var(--aster-copy-colour);font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;text-align:center;opacity:.64}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__privacy a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:2px}
  #{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__password-link{position:absolute;z-index:60;right:22px;bottom:18px;color:var(--aster-copy-colour);font-size:12px;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;opacity:.58;transition:opacity 180ms ease}#{{ section_id }} .aster-landing__password-link:hover{opacity:.95}
